{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41614","headline":"观山水障子 · 伍乔","name":"观山水障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功绩精妍世少伦，图时应倍用心神。\n不知草木承何异，但见江山长带春。\n云势似离岩底石，浪花如动岸边苹。\n更疑独泛渔舟者，便是其中旧隐人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}